---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About The Tennis Plan | West LA Tennis" description="Learn why The Tennis Plan makes local tennis coaching easier to discover." canonicalPath="/about">
  <Header />
  <main class="coach-profile"><div class="profile-shell"><h1>About The Tennis Plan</h1><section><h2>Good tennis starts local</h2><p>The Tennis Plan helps West Los Angeles players discover trusted coaches, public courts, group lessons, and people to play with. We keep browsing public and move booking and messaging into the app, where players control their account and next steps.</p></section><section><h2>Our coach directory</h2><p>Every public coach has agreed to appear. Their courts, rates, and background are shown so a player can decide who to consider before signing up.</p></section></div></main>
</BaseLayout>
